第二部分：附加条款 / Part 2: Additional Terms
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

以下附加条款与第一部分同时适用；两者冲突时，以附加条款为准。

1. 保留署名
   任何副本或衍生作品（包括 fork、转载、二次修改后发布的版本），都必须在页面上
   和源代码中保留原作者署名“小狗咖啡猫”，不得删除、修改或替换。

2. 不得更改网站名称
   任何副本或衍生作品都必须保留网站名称“恋爱观察室”，不得删除、修改或替换。

3. 必须清除原作者的网站链接
   将本软件部署到你自己的网站或服务时，必须删除其中指向原作者网站或服务的全部
   链接和地址（包括但不限于源代码中 SITE_TARGETS 里的检测线路），并替换为你自己的。
   不得让你的部署继续检测、推荐或链接到原作者的网站。

违反以上任何一条，本许可证授予你的全部权利自动终止。

The following additional terms apply together with Part 1. Where they
conflict, these additional terms prevail.

1. Attribution. Every copy or derivative work (including forks, reposts and
   modified versions) must keep the original author credit "小狗咖啡猫" both on
   the page and in the source code. The credit must not be removed, altered or
   replaced.

2. Site name. Every copy or derivative work must keep the site name "恋爱观察室".
   The name must not be removed, altered or replaced.

3. Removal of the author's links. When you deploy the Software on your own site
   or service, you must remove every link and address pointing to the original
   author's sites or services (including, without limitation, the probe targets
   in SITE_TARGETS in the source code) and replace them with your own. Your
   deployment must not keep probing, recommending or linking to the original
   author's sites.

Any violation of these terms automatically terminates all rights granted to you
under this license.
